===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|kingdom}}, {{m|enm|kyngdom}}, from {{inh|en|ang|cyningdōm}} from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*kuningadōmaz}}, equivalent to {{af|en|king|-dom}}. Cognate with {{cog|sco|kingdom}}, {{cog|fy|keuningdom}}, {{cog|nl|koningdom}}, {{cog|de|Königtum}}, {{cog|da|kongedømme}}, {{cog|sv|kungadöme}}, and {{cog|is|konungdómur}}.

{{etymon|en|id=monarch lead realm|:inh|enm:kingdom<id:monarch's realm>|tree=1}}

